  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7ae829b1f0e4cd6",
      "translationZh": "我们是Neuphonic团队，我们在Apache 2.0许可证下开源NeuDecide。它接受音频和工具定义，并返回带参数的工具调用，无需中间转录步骤。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8e381a6f3f80bd2",
      "translationZh": "模型文件总大小为 43 MB，推理在单个 CPU 线程上运行。在浏览器中尝试 WASM 演示：选择预设或定义自己的工具，录制或上传音频，并检查返回的工具调用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5993570fdf19ec38",
      "translationZh": "在 SLURP 的仅工具任务中，提供 10 种工具，NeuDecide 直接从语音实现 72.4% 的工具准确率，无需转录：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be771c32595ec6bf",
      "translationZh": "约为 Nvidia Parakeet + Google FunctionGemma（24.4%）的 3 倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "79e7d30d1498f18b",
      "translationZh": "约为 Cactus（Whistle + Needle）（20.7%）的 3.5 倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e913de7a82678a6c",
      "translationZh": "在单个 CPU 线程上运行：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41419db44ecf6f37",
      "translationZh": "MacBook Pro M3：调用耗时 46 ms，加载时间 159 ms，峰值内存占用 149 MB。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e4105c64ef0f44f",
      "translationZh": "Samsung S24+：调用耗时 82 ms，加载时间 267 ms，峰值内存占用 174 MB。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ea9b56a08ecd5ed5",
      "translationZh": "Raspberry Pi 5：调用时间 206 ms，加载时间 499 ms，峰值内存 146 MB.",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f895d47d12e366f",
      "translationZh": "导出包含三个 ONNX 图：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4bf2ad8b22bc412",
      "translationZh": "音频编码器处理语音。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "895ffd4883f0bcdd",
      "translationZh": "工具编码器将音频表示与 tokenised JSON 工具定义结合。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd20333d6797b969",
      "translationZh": "解码器使用缓存的键和值，逐 token 生成工具调用 token。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9189983ee764efc",
      "translationZh": "工具列表是每个请求的输入，因此更改可用操作不需要重新训练。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11d1e3cf0f1e91c6",
      "translationZh": "尝试使用您自己的工具",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e69552fd1f343147",
      "translationZh": "该项目源于我们与机器人合作伙伴的工作，他们需要在受限硬件上进行语音控制。演示包括可编辑的机器人吸尘器、汽车控制和智能家居预设，以及用于测试您自己的工具定义的自定义选项。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4178fb014289d6d9",
      "translationZh": "我们还为 Python 打包了 NeuDecide，这样您就可以在本地运行推理并使用自己的工具定义进行测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4c404a9aaa8b418",
      "translationZh": "我们选择了 Apache 2.0 许可证，以便让人们更容易在此模型基础上进行构建和贡献。我们很高兴看到 TypeSafe、Cactus 以及其他人在这一领域的工作，并希望这能提供一些有用的东西。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22c4a4eb1d125292",
      "translationZh": "技术文章：https://www.neuphonic.com/blog/neudecide",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0eae992226c77db",
      "translationZh": "Python 包：https://github.com/neuphonic/neudecide",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84c0451f5a93ba17",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 上的模型：https://huggingface.co/neuphonic/neudecide",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85d0ecbfbfb130d9",
      "translationZh": "如果您尝试使用它，我们很想了解您的硬件、工具定义以及它在处理时遇到困难的任何请求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08c838aedacedd76",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/TeamNeuphonic 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
